      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The risk associated with simplified models, particularly in high-stakes legal analysis, is substantial. Constitutional nuances and precedent distinctions are precisely where deeper contextual understanding becomes critical, and sacrificing that depth for cost savings introduces significant liability. I would strongly advise against accepting a higher risk profile simply to trim infrastructure fat.",
